  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Mirage City (Live)**: rare: 12 archived performances [4]\n- **Black Tooth (Live)**: back after 78 archived shows (699 days); rare: 14 archived performances [4]\n- **Chang'e (Live)**: rare: 9 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2024-08-31.bandcampbootlegger** (recommended): soundboard; 18 songs; 119 min [1]\n- **kglw2024-08-31.mk21.flac24**: source not stated; 18 songs; 119 min [3]\n- **kglw2024-08-31.mk4v**: source not stated; 18 songs; 119 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Jay Weinburg performed on drums for the set [2]\n- Jay Weinberg played drums during the performance [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2024-08-31.bandcampbootlegger**: taped by Sam Joseph; source: SBD [1]. Also: Sam Joseph, Joe Santarpia, and Grace King recorded the audio for the band [1]\n- **kglw2024-08-31.mk21.flac24**: taped by Brian Porter; source: Schoeps mk21 (ORTF wide) > kcy > Sonosax SX-M2/LS2 > Sony M10 (24/96) [3]. Also: Sony M10 recorded 24/96 audio, later transferred to flac via Sound Studio and xACT [3]\n- **kglw2024-08-31.mk4v**: taped by Brent Stober; transferred by Brent Stober; source: Schoeps mk4v > kc5 > cmc6 > Sound Device Mix Pre 6 II @ 32/48 [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by panetory.com: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Ascend Amphitheater Nashville TN Aug 31 2024 Poster 2026](https://panetory.com/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-ascend-amphitheater-nashville-tn-aug-31-2024-poster) [5]\n- Fan art by Jason Galea Standard Edition: [King Gizzard & the Lizard Wizard setlist - 2024-08-31 Ascend Amphitheater, Nashville, TN, USA](https://kglw.net/setlists/king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-august-31-2024-ascend-amphitheater-nashville-tn-usa.html) [6]\n- Poster by Ascend Amphitheater: [King Gizzard and The Lizard Wizard Tickets | 31st August | Ascend Amphitheater](https://www.nashvilleamphitheater.net/events/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-31-august-2024/) [7]",
